# The Talekeeper's Gift (bastok 56): the zone-in to Qufim Island at Prog 7 from elsewhere (no event), then from
# Behemoth's Dominion with a full inventory (100, not completed), then with room (completed).
char zone=BastokMines pos=-13,7,29 job=WAR lvl=50
quest Bastok.TheTalekeepersGift accepted
charvar Quest[1][56]Prog 7
login
warp -286.271,-21.619,320.084 QufimIsland   # from Bastok Mines: no event
warp 211,4,-79 BehemothsDominion
fill-inventory
zoneline QufimIsland            # 100, answered 0: inventory full, not completed
zoneline BehemothsDominion
free-inventory
zoneline QufimIsland            # 100: completed
